<div class="snp">
  <div class="snp__head">
    <p class="snp__eyebrow">Terms and policies</p>
    <h2 class="snp__title">Returns and refunds</h2>
    <p class="snp__lead">Doesn't fit, or not quite what you pictured? Here's how to send it back and get your money returned.</p>
    <p class="snp__date">Last updated October 7, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__facts">
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">30 days</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">to return from delivery</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">100%</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">of the purchase price back</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">14 days</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">at most to your refund</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Faulty?</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">we pay shipping both ways</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">01</span>How to return</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ol class="snp__steps">
        <li>Write to <a href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">support@daltonpierce.com</a> within 30 days of delivery with your order number and the items you'd like to send back.</li>
        <li>We'll reply with the return address and a short guide – usually within 1–2 business days.</li>
        <li>Pack the item securely and send it with a tracked service. Keep the receipt and the tracking number.</li>
        <li>We'll let you know when your return has arrived and send your refund.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="snp__note"><p><strong>Wait for our reply before you send anything.</strong> The sender address on the parcel is a warehouse that can't accept returns. Parcels sent there without our instructions are hard to recover – and then we can't process your return.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">02</span>The deadline</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>You have <strong>30 days</strong> to return an item, counted from the day you receive it. You're on time as long as you've written to us within the 30 days – the item must then be sent no later than 14 days after your message.</p>
      <p>If your order arrives in several parcels, the 30 days are counted from the day you receive the last parcel.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">03</span>What can be returned?</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>You can return any item – clothing, shoes, bags, belts, sunglasses and jewellery. You may try the item on as you would in a store.</p>
      <p>If it has been worn beyond trying on, washed or had its tags removed, we may deduct an amount from the refund that reflects the loss in value. So please send items back with the tags still attached.</p>
      <p>Sealed hygiene items – underwear and piercing jewellery – can't be returned once the seal has been broken after delivery.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">04</span>Return shipping</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>You pay for return shipping, unless the item is faulty, damaged or not what you ordered – then we pay.</p>
      <p>Use a tracked service. The parcel is your responsibility until it reaches us, and without tracking we can't help if it gets lost on the way.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">05</span>Refunds</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ul>
        <li>You get back the full amount you paid for the returned items, to the payment method you used.</li>
        <li>If you bought several items with a multi-buy discount and return only some of them, you get back the amount you actually paid for the returned items – including the discount they received. The discount on the items you keep doesn't change.</li>
        <li>If you return your whole order, any shipping charge is refunded too – with us, shipping is free.</li>
        <li>We refund you no later than 14 days after we receive your return or proof that you've sent it.</li>
        <li>Your bank usually takes another 3–5 business days to show the amount.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">06</span>Exchanges</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We don't exchange sizes or colours directly. Send the item back for a refund and place a new order in the size you want – that way your size won't sell out while your return is on its way.</p>
      <p>Not sure about the size? Go by the measurements on the product page, or write to us with the item name and we'll help you before you order again.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">07</span>Cancelling before shipping</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Changed your mind before the order has shipped? Write to us as soon as possible with your order number – there's a short window before the order goes to the warehouse. If we can catch it, we'll cancel and refund the full amount.</p>
      <p>If the order has already shipped, the carrier can't stop it. Accept the parcel and return it as described above.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">08</span>Faulty, damaged or wrong items</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">support@daltonpierce.com</a> with your order number and a few photos as soon as possible after you notice the problem – within 2 months is always on time.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We send a new item or refund your money.</li>
        <li>We pay the shipping both ways.</li>
        <li>We can often settle the matter from the photos alone, without you having to send anything back.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We also use the photos when we raise the issue with the maker or the carrier. None of this limits any rights you have under the consumer protection laws of your province or territory.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__help">
    <p class="snp__help-title">Want to return something?</p>
    <p>Send us your order number and you'll get the return address in our reply.</p>
    <a class="snp__btn" href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com?subject=Return">Start a return</a>
    <p class="snp__help-meta">support@daltonpierce.com · Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00 CET · reply within 1–2 business days</p>
  </div>

